{
  "name": "Generate a talking-actor UGC video from a script with Clipwright",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "6f1c2a10-0001-4c3e-9a01-000000000101",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-480, -320],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 1,
        "width": 440,
        "height": 860,
        "content": "## Generate a talking-actor UGC video from a script with Clipwright\n\n### Who it's for\nMarketers and agencies who want short vertical ads with an AI actor reading their script, started from n8n.\n\n### How it works\n1. **Script** holds your script and a credit ceiling, `max_credits`.\n2. **Quote UGC** asks Clipwright what the video will cost. Quotes are free.\n3. **Within budget?** stops at **Over budget** when the quote is above `max_credits`; nothing is spent.\n4. **Make UGC** starts the render and returns a `run_id` at once.\n5. **Wait**, **Get run** and **Finished?** check the run every 15 seconds until it ends.\n6. **Result** holds the state and the video URL: a 1080×1920 MP4 by default.\n\n### How to set up\n1. Sign up at clipwright.io. A new account gets 420 trial credits.\n2. Create an API key at app.clipwright.io/api-keys.\n3. In n8n, add a **Bearer Auth** credential with that key and select it in **Quote UGC**, **Make UGC** and **Get run**.\n4. Edit the script and `max_credits` in **Script**, then run the workflow.\n\n### Requirements\n- A Clipwright account. A talking-actor video costs 30 credits per second of finished video.\n- An n8n version with the built-in MCP Client node. No community node is needed.\n\n### How to customize\n- Replace **Start** with a form, a schedule or a new row in a sheet.\n- Send the video URL on to storage or a teammate: the link expires after 7 days."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "6f1c2a10-0001-4c3e-9a01-000000000102",
      "name": "Step 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [160, -160],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 200,
        "height": 320,
        "content": "## 1. Set the script\nEdit `script` and `max_credits` here. The quote is checked against `max_credits` before any credits are spent."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "6f1c2a10-0001-4c3e-9a01-000000000103",
      "name": "Step 2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [400, -160],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 400,
        "height": 320,
        "content": "## 2. Check the price\nThe quote is free. Above `max_credits`, the run goes to **Over budget** and stops."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "6f1c2a10-0001-4c3e-9a01-000000000104",
      "name": "Step 3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [840, -340],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 1040,
        "height": 380,
        "content": "## 3. Render and collect\n**Make UGC** spends credits. The loop checks the run every 15 seconds; **Result** holds the video URL."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "6f1c2a10-0001-4c3e-9a01-000000000001",
      "name": "Start",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [0, 0],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "6f1c2a10-0001-4c3e-9a01-000000000002",
      "name": "Script",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [220, 0],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "6f1c2a10-0001-4c3e-9a01-0000000000a1",
              "name": "script",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "This bottle keeps coffee hot for twelve hours. Fill it at seven, drink it hot at lunch."
            },
            {
              "id": "6f1c2a10-0001-4c3e-9a01-0000000000a2",
              "name": "max_credits",
              "type": "number",
              "value": 400
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "6f1c2a10-0001-4c3e-9a01-000000000003",
      "name": "Quote UGC",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.mcpClient",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [440, 0],
      "parameters": {
        "serverTransport": "httpStreamable",
        "endpointUrl": "https://mcp.clipwright.io/mcp",
        "authentication": "bearerAuth",
        "tool": { "__rl": true, "mode": "id", "value": "quote_ugc" },
        "inputMode": "json",
        "jsonInput": "={{ JSON.stringify({ script: $('Script').item.json.script }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "credentials": { "httpBearerAuth": { "id": "clipwright", "name": "Clipwright API key" } }
    },
    {
      "id": "6f1c2a10-0001-4c3e-9a01-000000000009",
      "name": "Within budget?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [660, 0],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "strict", "version": 2 },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "6f1c2a10-0001-4c3e-9a01-0000000000c2",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.content[0].text.credits_estimate }}",
              "rightValue": "={{ $('Script').item.json.max_credits }}",
              "operator": { "type": "number", "operation": "lte" }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "6f1c2a10-0001-4c3e-9a01-000000000010",
      "name": "Over budget",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [880, 240],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            { "id": "6f1c2a10-0001-4c3e-9a01-0000000000e1", "name": "credits_estimate", "type": "number", "value": "={{ $json.content[0].text.credits_estimate }}" },
            { "id": "6f1c2a10-0001-4c3e-9a01-0000000000e2", "name": "max_credits", "type": "number", "value": "={{ $('Script').item.json.max_credits }}" }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "6f1c2a10-0001-4c3e-9a01-000000000004",
      "name": "Make UGC",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.mcpClient",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [880, -100],
      "parameters": {
        "serverTransport": "httpStreamable",
        "endpointUrl": "https://mcp.clipwright.io/mcp",
        "authentication": "bearerAuth",
        "tool": { "__rl": true, "mode": "id", "value": "make_ugc" },
        "inputMode": "json",
        "jsonInput": "={{ JSON.stringify({ script: $('Script').item.json.script }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "credentials": { "httpBearerAuth": { "id": "clipwright", "name": "Clipwright API key" } }
    },
    {
      "id": "6f1c2a10-0001-4c3e-9a01-000000000005",
      "name": "Wait",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [1100, -100],
      "webhookId": "6f1c2a10-0001-4c3e-9a01-0000000000b1",
      "parameters": { "resume": "timeInterval", "amount": 15, "unit": "seconds" }
    },
    {
      "id": "6f1c2a10-0001-4c3e-9a01-000000000006",
      "name": "Get run",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.mcpClient",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [1320, -100],
      "parameters": {
        "serverTransport": "httpStreamable",
        "endpointUrl": "https://mcp.clipwright.io/mcp",
        "authentication": "bearerAuth",
        "tool": { "__rl": true, "mode": "id", "value": "get_run" },
        "inputMode": "json",
        "jsonInput": "={{ JSON.stringify({ run_id: $('Make UGC').item.json.content[0].text.run_id }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "credentials": { "httpBearerAuth": { "id": "clipwright", "name": "Clipwright API key" } }
    },
    {
      "id": "6f1c2a10-0001-4c3e-9a01-000000000007",
      "name": "Finished?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [1540, -100],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "strict", "version": 2 },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "6f1c2a10-0001-4c3e-9a01-0000000000c1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.content[0].text.status }}",
              "rightValue": "IN_PROGRESS",
              "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "notEquals" }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "6f1c2a10-0001-4c3e-9a01-000000000008",
      "name": "Result",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [1760, -200],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            { "id": "6f1c2a10-0001-4c3e-9a01-0000000000d1", "name": "run_id", "type": "string", "value": "={{ $json.content[0].text.run_id }}" },
            { "id": "6f1c2a10-0001-4c3e-9a01-0000000000d2", "name": "state", "type": "string", "value": "={{ $json.content[0].text.state }}" },
            { "id": "6f1c2a10-0001-4c3e-9a01-0000000000d3", "name": "video_url", "type": "string", "value": "={{ $json.content[0].text.video_url ?? '' }}" },
            { "id": "6f1c2a10-0001-4c3e-9a01-0000000000d4", "name": "error", "type": "string", "value": "={{ $json.content[0].text.error ?? '' }}" }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Start": { "main": [[{ "node": "Script", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Script": { "main": [[{ "node": "Quote UGC", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Quote UGC": { "main": [[{ "node": "Within budget?", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Within budget?": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Make UGC", "type": "main", "index": 0 }],
        [{ "node": "Over budget", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "Make UGC": { "main": [[{ "node": "Wait", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Wait": { "main": [[{ "node": "Get run", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Get run": { "main": [[{ "node": "Finished?", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Finished?": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Result", "type": "main", "index": 0 }],
        [{ "node": "Wait", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": { "executionOrder": "v1" },
  "pinData": {}
}
